From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nds-ports <nds-ports@localhost>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:43:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add touch buttons, level stats and a keyboard to the touch
 screen

Above the status bar the touch screen shows the level name, kills,
secrets and time, and buttons for jump, scores, center view and the
console. Tapping the weapon icons of the status bar selects a weapon.
With the console or a chat message open a keyboard covers the lower
half. The buttons send the keys of the default bindings. Dragging the
stylus anywhere else still looks around.

The UI rows are kept out of the view rectangle that is cleared every
frame and only redrawn when what they show changes or something else
drew over them, and the changed rows of the 2D drawing are tracked per
row instead of as one range.
---
 WinQuake/in_nds.c  | 214 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 WinQuake/input.h   |   5 ++
 WinQuake/vid.h     |   5 ++
 WinQuake/vid_nds.c |  71 +++++++++------
 4 files changed, 264 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)

